   "q": "<p>Ebru, kısa kenarı 20 cm, uzun kenarı 30 cm olan dikdörtgen biçimli fotoğrafı için ahşap bir çerçeve yaptıracaktır. Çerçevenin sağ ve sol kenarlarının genişliği 3’er cm olacak; alt ve üst kenarlarının genişlikleri ise birbirine eşit olacaktır.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 392\" width=\"400\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Fotoğraf 20 cm x 30 cm; sağ ve sol çerçeve genişliği 3 cm; üst ve alt genişlik soru işareti\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><rect x=\"120.0\" y=\"30.0\" width=\"208.0\" height=\"312.0\" fill=\"#d6a76c\" stroke=\"#7c4a12\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"144.0\" y=\"66.0\" width=\"160.0\" height=\"240.0\" fill=\"#dbeafe\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"236.0\" y=\"156.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\" font-weight=\"bold\">fotoğraf</text><line x1=\"144.0\" y1=\"292.0\" x2=\"304.0\" y2=\"292.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"144.0\" y1=\"287.0\" x2=\"144.0\" y2=\"297.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"304.0\" y1=\"287.0\" x2=\"304.0\" y2=\"297.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"224.0\" y=\"285.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">20 cm</text><line x1=\"160.0\" y1=\"66.0\" x2=\"160.0\" y2=\"306.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"155.0\" y1=\"66.0\" x2=\"165.0\" y2=\"66.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"155.0\" y1=\"306.0\" x2=\"165.0\" y2=\"306.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"167.0\" y=\"191.0\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">30 cm</text><line x1=\"120.0\" y1=\"360.0\" x2=\"144.0\" y2=\"360.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"120.0\" y1=\"355.0\" x2=\"120.0\" y2=\"365.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"144.0\" y1=\"355.0\" x2=\"144.0\" y2=\"365.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"132.0\" y=\"377.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">3 cm</text><line x1=\"304.0\" y1=\"360.0\" x2=\"328.0\" y2=\"360.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"304.0\" y1=\"355.0\" x2=\"304.0\" y2=\"365.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"328.0\" y1=\"355.0\" x2=\"328.0\" y2=\"365.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"316.0\" y=\"377.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">3 cm</text><line x1=\"346.0\" y1=\"30.0\" x2=\"346.0\" y2=\"66.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"341.0\" y1=\"30.0\" x2=\"351.0\" y2=\"30.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"341.0\" y1=\"66.0\" x2=\"351.0\" y2=\"66.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"353.0\" y=\"53.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">?</text><line x1=\"346.0\" y1=\"306.0\" x2=\"346.0\" y2=\"342.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"341.0\" y1=\"306.0\" x2=\"351.0\" y2=\"306.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"341.0\" y1=\"342.0\" x2=\"351.0\" y2=\"342.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"353.0\" y=\"329.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">?</text></svg></div><p>Ebru, çerçevenin dış kenarlarının oluşturduğu dikdörtgenin fotoğrafa <b>benzer</b> olmasını istemektedir.</p><p><b>Buna göre çerçevenin üst kenarının genişliği kaç santimetre olmalıdır?</b></p>",
