   "a": "B",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>P banda 40 cm, Q banda 80 cm uzakta.</li> <li>Dikme ayakları arası 180 cm.</li> <li>İki dik üçgen benzer.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>x (H'nin P'nin dikme ayağına uzaklığı).</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Dik kenarları yaz</b> Küçük üçgen: 40 ve x. Büyük üçgen: 80 ve 180 − x.</li> <li><b>Benzerlik oranı</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">k = {{80|40}} = 2 → 180 − x = 2x</span></li> <li><b>Çöz</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">3x = 180 → x = 60 cm</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 480 235\" width=\"480\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Büyük üçgen küçüğün 2 katı: 180 − x = 2x → x = 60 cm\" font-family=\"sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"440\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#16a34a\" opacity=\"0.25\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><polygon points=\"60,120 60,40 180,40\" fill=\"#e0f2fe\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><polygon points=\"420,200 420,40 180,40\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><path d=\"M60 52 L72 52 L72 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M420 52 L408 52 L408 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"120\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"420\" cy=\"200\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#dc2626\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"145\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">P</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"225\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Q</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"32\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">H</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"85\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#0e7490\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">40</text><text x=\"432\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#ea580c\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">80</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#0e7490\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">x = 60</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#ea580c\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">180 − x = 120</text></svg><figcaption>Büyük üçgen küçüğün 2 katı: 180 − x = 2x → x = 60 cm</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Banttan yansımada geliş ve yansıma açıları eşit olduğundan iki dik üçgen benzerdir; yatay uzaklık, dik uzaklıklar oranında bölünür (1 : 2).</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> 180’i eşit bölen 90; oranı ters kuran 120 bulur.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>B</b></div></div>"
