   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<p>Aşağıdaki kareli zeminde her karenin kenar uzunluğu 5 cm’dir. A ve B noktaları zeminin üst kenarı üzerinde, D ve C noktaları alt kenarı üzerindedir. [AC] ile [BD], E noktasında kesişmektedir.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 420 270\" width=\"420\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Kareli zemin 6 kare x 4 kare; A ve B üst çizgide, D ve C alt çizgide; AC ile BD E noktasında kesişiyor\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><line x1=\"60.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"60.0\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"110.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"110.0\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"160.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"160.0\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"210.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"210.0\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"260.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"260.0\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"310.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"310.0\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"360.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"360.0\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"60.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"360.0\" y2=\"40.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"60.0\" y1=\"90.0\" x2=\"360.0\" y2=\"90.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"60.0\" y1=\"140.0\" x2=\"360.0\" y2=\"140.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"60.0\" y1=\"190.0\" x2=\"360.0\" y2=\"190.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"60.0\" y1=\"240.0\" x2=\"360.0\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"60.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"310.0\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"160.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"160.0\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"60.0\" cy=\"40.0\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><circle cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"40.0\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><circle cx=\"310.0\" cy=\"240.0\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><circle cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"240.0\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><circle cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"120.0\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#dc2626\"/><text x=\"50.0\" y=\"32.0\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">A</text><text x=\"160.0\" y=\"30.0\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">B</text><text x=\"160.0\" y=\"262.0\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">D</text><text x=\"314.0\" y=\"262.0\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">C</text><text x=\"144.0\" y=\"124.0\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">E</text><line x1=\"310.0\" y1=\"28.0\" x2=\"360.0\" y2=\"28.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"310.0\" y1=\"23.0\" x2=\"310.0\" y2=\"33.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"360.0\" y1=\"23.0\" x2=\"360.0\" y2=\"33.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"335.0\" y=\"21.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">5 cm</text><line x1=\"376.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"376.0\" y2=\"90.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"371.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"381.0\" y2=\"40.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"371.0\" y1=\"90.0\" x2=\"381.0\" y2=\"90.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"383.0\" y=\"70.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">5 cm</text></svg></div><p><b>Buna göre AEB üçgeninin alanı kaç santimetrekaredir?</b></p>",
