   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<p>Aşağıdaki kareli zeminde, dik kenarları zeminin çizgileri üzerinde olan I, II, III, IV ve V numaralı dik üçgenler verilmiştir.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 530 220\" width=\"530\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Kareli zeminde beş dik üçgen; dik kenarları I: 2 ve 1, II: 1 ve 3, III: 4 ve 2, IV: 2 ve 6, V: 6 ve 3 birim\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><line x1=\"20.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"20.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"42.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"42.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"64.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"64.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"86.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"86.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"108.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"108.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"130.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"130.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"152.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"152.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"174.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"174.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"196.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"196.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"218.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"218.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"240.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"240.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"262.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"262.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"284.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"284.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"306.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"306.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"328.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"328.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"350.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"350.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"372.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"372.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"394.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"394.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"416.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"416.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"438.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"438.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"460.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"460.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"482.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"482.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"504.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"504.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"20.0\" y1=\"20.0\" x2=\"504.0\" y2=\"20.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"20.0\" y1=\"42.0\" x2=\"504.0\" y2=\"42.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"20.0\" y1=\"64.0\" x2=\"504.0\" y2=\"64.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"20.0\" y1=\"86.0\" x2=\"504.0\" y2=\"86.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"20.0\" y1=\"108.0\" x2=\"504.0\" y2=\"108.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"20.0\" y1=\"130.0\" x2=\"504.0\" y2=\"130.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"20.0\" y1=\"152.0\" x2=\"504.0\" y2=\"152.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"20.0\" y1=\"174.0\" x2=\"504.0\" y2=\"174.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"20.0\" y1=\"196.0\" x2=\"504.0\" y2=\"196.0\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"42.0,174.0 86.0,174.0 42.0,152.0\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"64.0\" y=\"189.4\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">I</text><polygon points=\"108.0,174.0 130.0,174.0 108.0,108.0\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"119.0\" y=\"189.4\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">II</text><polygon points=\"174.0,174.0 262.0,174.0 174.0,130.0\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"218.0\" y=\"189.4\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">III</text><polygon points=\"306.0,174.0 350.0,174.0 306.0,42.0\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"328.0\" y=\"189.4\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">IV</text><polygon points=\"372.0,174.0 504.0,174.0 372.0,108.0\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"438.0\" y=\"189.4\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">V</text></svg></div><p>Bu üçgenlerden birbirine benzer olan herhangi ikisi seçilip küçüğün büyüğe benzerlik oranı hesaplanacaktır.</p><p><b>Buna göre bu oran aşağıdakilerden hangisi <u>olamaz</u>?</b></p>",
