   "a": "A",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>B, A'nın tam karşısında, kıyıdan 2 m içeride.</li> <li>|BC| = 12 m, |CD| = 4 m, |DE| = 6 m; A, C, E doğrusal.</li> <li>ABC ~ EDC.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Nehrin genişliği.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Oran</b> [BC] ↔ [DC]. <span class=\"sv-m\">k = {{12|4}} = 3</span></li> <li><b>|AB|</b> [AB] ↔ [ED]. <span class=\"sv-m\">|AB| = 3 · 6 = 18 m</span></li> <li><b>Nehir genişliği</b> B kıyıdan 2 m içeride. <span class=\"sv-m\">18 − 2 = 16 m</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 340\" width=\"340\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"|AB| = 3 · 6 = 18 m; kıyıdan içerideki 2 m çıkarılınca nehir 16 m\" font-family=\"sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"34\" width=\"300\" height=\"192\" fill=\"#bae6fd\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"226\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"226\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"34\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"290\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#0e7490\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">nehir</text><polygon points=\"60,34 60,250 204,250\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><polygon points=\"252,322 252,250 204,250\" fill=\"#fde68a\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"252\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M60 238 L72 238 L72 250\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M240 250 L240 262 L252 262\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"48\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">A</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"262\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">B</text><text x=\"204\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">C</text><text x=\"262\" y=\"252\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">D</text><text x=\"262\" y=\"330\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">E</text><text x=\"132\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">12</text><text x=\"228\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">4</text><text x=\"262\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#ea580c\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">6</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">18</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"242\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">2</text></svg><figcaption>|AB| = 3 · 6 = 18 m; kıyıdan içerideki 2 m çıkarılınca nehir 16 m</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Ölçülen uzunluğun gerçekten istenen şey olup olmadığını kontrol et; burada fazladan 2 m var.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> 18, kıyıdan içerideki 2 m’yi çıkarmamaktır.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>A</b></div></div>"
