   "a": "D",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>ABC dik üçgen, dik açı B'de; |AB| = 6 m, |BC| = 12 m.</li> <li>BFED karesi; E, [AC] üzerinde.</li> <li>ADE ~ ABC.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Havuzun alanı.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Bilinmeyeni seç</b> Karenin kenarı a olsun. <span class=\"sv-m\">|DE| = a, |AD| = 6 − a</span></li> <li><b>Orantı</b> ADE ~ ABC: [AD] ↔ [AB], [DE] ↔ [BC]. <span class=\"sv-m\">{{6 − a|6}} = {{a|12}}</span></li> <li><b>Çöz</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">12(6 − a) = 6a → 72 = 18a → a = 4 m</span></li> <li><b>Alan</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">4 · 4 = 16 m²</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 410 220\" width=\"410\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"ADE (turuncu) ~ ABC: (6 − a) / 6 = a / 12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\"><g transform=\"translate(30,0)\"><polygon points=\"40,40 40,190 340,190\" fill=\"#dcfce7\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><polygon points=\"40,90 140,90 140,190 40,190\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><polygon points=\"40,40 40,90 140,90\" fill=\"#fde68a\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><path d=\"M40 178 L52 178 L52 190\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"28.6863\" y=\"33.6863\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">A</text><text x=\"25.6892\" y=\"202.155\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">B</text><text x=\"355.522\" y=\"198.881\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">C</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"95\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">D</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">E</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">F</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"68\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#ea580c\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">6 − a</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"145\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#0e7490\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">a</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#0e7490\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">a</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">12</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"145\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#0e7490\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">havuz</text></g></svg><figcaption>ADE (turuncu) ~ ABC: (6 − a) / 6 = a / 12</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Dik üçgene yerleşen karenin kenarı = (dik kenarların çarpımı) ÷ (toplamı): 6 · 12 ÷ 18 = 4.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> a’yı bulup alanı hesaplamadan 4’ü cevap sanmak; şıklarda yoksa 16 olduğunu unutma.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>D</b></div></div>"
