   "a": "C",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>KLMN dikdörtgen; |KA| = 9, |KB| = 12, |KL| = 24, |LM| = 15 (kareli zeminden).</li> <li>BLC ~ AKB, CMD ~ AKB.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>A'dan D'ye toplam yolun en küçük değeri.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>İlk yol</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">|AB| = √(9² + 12²) = 15</span> <span class=\"sv-m\">|BL| = 24 − 12 = 12</span></li> <li><b>B → C</b> L ↔ K (dik açı). İki ihtimal: <span class=\"sv-m\">[BL] ↔ [KB]: oran 1 → |LC| = 9, |BC| = 15 ✓</span> <span class=\"sv-m\">[BL] ↔ [KA]: oran {{4|3}} → |LC| = 16 &gt; 15 ✗ (kenarın dışına çıkar)</span></li> <li><b>C → D</b> |CM| = 15 − 9 = 6. İki ihtimal: <span class=\"sv-m\">[CM] ↔ [KB]: oran {{1|2}} → |CD| = 7,5</span> <span class=\"sv-m\">[CM] ↔ [KA]: oran {{2|3}} → |CD| = 10</span></li> <li><b>En az yol</b> <span class=\"sv-m\">15 + 15 + 7,5 = 37,5 birim</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 265\" width=\"400\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"En kısa yol: 15 (AB) + 15 (BC) + 7,5 (CD) = 37,5 birim\" font-family=\"sans-serif\"><polygon points=\"30,240 366,240 366,30 30,30\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><polygon points=\"30,114 30,240 198,240\" fill=\"#e0f2fe\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><polygon points=\"198,240 366,240 366,114\" fill=\"#dcfce7\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><polygon points=\"366,114 366,30 303,30\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"114\" x2=\"198\" y2=\"240\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"198\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"366\" y2=\"114\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"366\" y1=\"114\" x2=\"303\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"16.432\" y=\"253.48\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">K</text><text x=\"379.568\" y=\"253.48\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">L</text><text x=\"379.568\" y=\"26.52\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">M</text><text x=\"16.432\" y=\"26.52\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">N</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"118\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">A</text><text x=\"198\" y=\"258\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">B</text><text x=\"376\" y=\"118\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">C</text><text x=\"303\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">D</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#0e7490\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">9</text><text x=\"114\" y=\"232\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#0e7490\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">12</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#0e7490\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">15</text><text x=\"282\" y=\"232\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#16a34a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">12</text><text x=\"356\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#16a34a\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">9</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#16a34a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">15</text><text x=\"356\" y=\"75\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#ea580c\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">6</text><text x=\"334\" y=\"46\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#ea580c\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">4,5</text><text x=\"318\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#ea580c\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">7,5</text></svg><figcaption>En kısa yol: 15 (AB) + 15 (BC) + 7,5 (CD) = 37,5 birim</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Her adımda iki eşlemeyi dene, sonra noktanın kenar üzerinde kalıp kalmadığını kontrol et.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Kenar sınırını kontrol etmeyen |BC| = 20 alıp 42,5 bulur; 40 en uzun yoldur; 30 son adımı unutmaktır.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>C</b></div></div>"
