   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Pencere 1 m genişliğinde; Mert pencereye 2 m uzakta.</li> <li>Duvarın görülen kısmı 6 m.</li> <li>Mert pencereye 1 m yaklaşıyor.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Yeni durumda görülen duvar genişliği.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Pencere–duvar uzaklığı</b> d olsun; göz–duvar 2 + d. <span class=\"sv-m\">{{1|2}} = {{6|2 + d}} → 2 + d = 12 → d = 10 m</span></li> <li><b>Yeni durum</b> Göz pencereye 1 m, duvara 1 + 10 = 11 m uzakta. <span class=\"sv-m\">{{1|1}} = {{w|11}} → w = 11 m</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 335\" width=\"400\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Mavi: pencereye 2 m’den 6 m görülür; kırmızı: 1 m’den 11 m görülür (pencere–duvar 10 m)\" font-family=\"sans-serif\"><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"32\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"188\" y1=\"272\" x2=\"212\" y2=\"272\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"320\" x2=\"128\" y2=\"32\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"320\" x2=\"272\" y2=\"32\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"296\" x2=\"68\" y2=\"32\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"296\" x2=\"332\" y2=\"32\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"32\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><line x1=\"350\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"32\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"320\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#0e7490\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"296\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#dc2626\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#0e7490\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">6 m</text><text x=\"332\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">11 m (yeni)</text><text x=\"224\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#16a34a\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">pencere 1 m</text><text x=\"212\" y=\"326\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#0e7490\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">göz (2 m)</text><text x=\"188\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">yeni (1 m)</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">10 m</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">duvar</text></svg><figcaption>Mavi: pencereye 2 m’den 6 m görülür; kırmızı: 1 m’den 11 m görülür (pencere–duvar 10 m)</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Önce sabit kalan mesafeyi (pencere–duvar) bul, sonra yeni konumla yeniden orantı kur.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Mesafe yarıya indi diye görüntünün 2 katına çıkacağını sanmak 12; yarıya ineceğini sanmak 3 verir.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>B</b></div></div>"
